; Exercises the less common CiA 306 constructs: compact storage with
; [XXXXName] and [XXXXValue], object links, data type definitions,
; the long integer and string types, DOMAIN files, ObjFlags, octal and
; decimal literals, vendor keys and a tools section.
; Written for go-canopen tests.

